WEBVTT

00:00:07.809 --> 00:00:10.290
You both realize, of course...

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:12.161
that in the past few hours,

00:00:12.161 --> 00:00:16.426
you have broken perhaps
a dozen school rules.

00:00:16.426 --> 00:00:18.167
Yes, sir.Yes, sir.

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:20.561
And there is sufficient evidence
to have you both expelled.

00:00:20.561 --> 00:00:22.867
Yes, sir.
Yes, sir.

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:24.869
Therefore...

00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:28.047
it is only fitting...

00:00:28.047 --> 00:00:29.657
that you both receive...

00:00:29.657 --> 00:00:34.096
Special Awards
for Services to the School.

00:00:36.142 --> 00:00:37.099
Thanks, sir.

00:00:38.231 --> 00:00:39.971
And now,
Mr. Weasley,

00:00:39.971 --> 00:00:41.625
if you would,

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:46.413
have an owl deliver
these release papers to Azkaban.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:48.371
I believe we...

00:00:48.371 --> 00:00:51.592
we want
our gamekeeper back.

00:00:53.289 --> 00:00:56.205
Harry...

00:00:56.205 --> 00:01:00.427
First, I want
to thank you, Harry.

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:02.907
You must have shown me
real loyalty

00:01:02.907 --> 00:01:04.735
down in the Chamber.

00:01:04.735 --> 00:01:09.392
Nothing but that could
have called Fawkes to you.

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:16.486
And second...

00:01:16.486 --> 00:01:21.056
I sense that something
is troubling you.

00:01:21.056 --> 00:01:25.539
Am I right, Harry?

00:01:25.539 --> 00:01:26.844
It's just--

00:01:28.107 --> 00:01:29.586
You see, sir, I--

00:01:29.586 --> 00:01:33.199
I couldn't help
but notice certain things...

00:01:33.199 --> 00:01:38.987
certain similarities
between Tom Riddle and me.

00:01:38.987 --> 00:01:41.468
I see.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:45.689
Well, you can speak
Parseltongue, Harry. Why?

00:01:48.257 --> 00:01:54.263
Because Lord Voldemort
can speak Parseltongue.

00:01:54.263 --> 00:01:57.440
If I'm not mistaken, Harry,

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:01.227
he transferred
some of his powers to you

00:02:01.227 --> 00:02:03.316
the night he gave you that scar.

00:02:03.316 --> 00:02:08.103
Voldemort transferred
some of his powers to me?

00:02:08.103 --> 00:02:10.323
Uh-huh.

00:02:10.323 --> 00:02:11.367
Not intentionally.

00:02:13.848 --> 00:02:15.545
But yes.

00:02:17.678 --> 00:02:19.941
So the Sorting Hat
was right.

00:02:19.941 --> 00:02:21.899
I should be in Slytherin.

00:02:21.899 --> 00:02:24.075
It's true, Harry. You possess
many of the qualities

00:02:24.075 --> 00:02:25.729
that Voldemort himself prizes.

00:02:25.729 --> 00:02:28.819
Determination,
resourcefulness,

00:02:28.819 --> 00:02:30.125
and if I may say so,

00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:31.605
a certain disregard
for the rules.

00:02:33.476 --> 00:02:34.999
Why, then,
did the Sorting Hat

00:02:34.999 --> 00:02:36.436
place you in Gryffindor?

00:02:38.742 --> 00:02:40.179
Because I asked it to.

00:02:40.179 --> 00:02:42.268
Exactly, Harry.
Exactly.

00:02:42.268 --> 00:02:44.444
Which makes you
different from Voldemort.

00:02:44.444 --> 00:02:48.404
It is not our abilities
that show what we truly are.

00:02:48.404 --> 00:02:50.754
It is our choices.

00:02:55.281 --> 00:02:58.327
If you want proof
why you belong in Gryffindor,

00:02:58.327 --> 00:03:03.724
then I suggest you look
more closely at this.

00:03:03.724 --> 00:03:05.726
Be careful.

00:03:10.992 --> 00:03:15.170
Godric Gryffindor.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:18.173
It would take a true Gryffindor
to pull that out of the hat.

00:03:26.921 --> 00:03:28.139
Dobby!

00:03:29.793 --> 00:03:32.013
So this is your master.

00:03:32.013 --> 00:03:34.102
The family you serve
is the Malfoys.

00:03:36.235 --> 00:03:39.325
I'll deal with you later.

00:03:46.027 --> 00:03:47.463
Out of my way, Potter.

00:03:47.463 --> 00:03:50.901
So it's true.
You have returned.

00:03:50.901 --> 00:03:52.947
When the governors learned

00:03:52.947 --> 00:03:55.645
that Arthur Weasley's daughter
was taken into the Chamber,

00:03:55.645 --> 00:03:58.735
they saw fit to summon me back.

00:03:58.735 --> 00:04:01.129
Ridiculous.

00:04:01.129 --> 00:04:03.131
Curiously, Lucius,

00:04:03.131 --> 00:04:05.481
several of them
were under the impression

00:04:05.481 --> 00:04:07.831
that you would
curse their families

00:04:07.831 --> 00:04:09.137
if they did not agree

00:04:09.137 --> 00:04:10.443
to suspend me
in the first place.

00:04:10.443 --> 00:04:12.967
How dare you?

00:04:12.967 --> 00:04:14.534
I beg your pardon?

00:04:14.534 --> 00:04:18.712
My sole concern has always been
and will always be

00:04:18.712 --> 00:04:21.802
the welfare of this school...

00:04:21.802 --> 00:04:25.849
and, of course, its students.

00:04:29.505 --> 00:04:34.031
The culprit has been identified,
I presume?

00:04:34.031 --> 00:04:35.903
Oh, yes.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:39.646
And?

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:41.125
Who was it?

00:04:48.655 --> 00:04:50.309
Voldemort.

00:04:50.309 --> 00:04:54.008
Ah.

00:04:54.008 --> 00:04:58.142
Only this time he chose to act
through somebody else...

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:02.321
by means of this.

00:05:04.671 --> 00:05:06.063
I see.

00:05:08.588 --> 00:05:12.243
Fortunately, our young
Mr. Potter discovered it.

00:05:12.243 --> 00:05:14.289
One hopes

00:05:14.289 --> 00:05:16.465
that no more of Lord Voldemort's
old school things

00:05:16.465 --> 00:05:19.729
should find their way
into innocent hands.

00:05:19.729 --> 00:05:23.951
The consequences for
the one responsible would be...

00:05:23.951 --> 00:05:26.127
severe.

00:05:28.085 --> 00:05:30.914
Well, let us hope

00:05:30.914 --> 00:05:36.137
that Mr. Potter will always
be around to save the day.

00:05:36.137 --> 00:05:40.750
Don't worry. I will be.

00:05:48.715 --> 00:05:50.107
Dumbledore.

00:05:52.109 --> 00:05:56.200
Come, Dobby.
We're leaving.

00:06:12.739 --> 00:06:14.393
Sir?

00:06:14.393 --> 00:06:17.439
I wonder if I could have that?

00:06:24.011 --> 00:06:25.839
Mr. Malfoy!

00:06:25.839 --> 00:06:28.494
Mr. Malfoy!

00:06:28.494 --> 00:06:30.365
I have something of yours.

00:06:31.801 --> 00:06:33.803
Mine?

00:06:33.803 --> 00:06:35.501
I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:06:35.501 --> 00:06:37.241
Oh, I think
you do, sir.

00:06:37.241 --> 00:06:40.810
I think you slipped the diary
into Ginny Weasley's cauldron

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.072
that day at Diagon Alley.

00:06:42.072 --> 00:06:45.336
You do, do you?

00:06:52.518 --> 00:06:55.695
Why don't you prove it?

00:07:01.701 --> 00:07:04.660
Come, Dobby.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.270
[WHISPERS]
Open it.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:13.626
Dobby?

00:07:13.626 --> 00:07:15.932
Master has given
Dobby a sock.

00:07:15.932 --> 00:07:19.109
What? I didn't give--

00:07:19.109 --> 00:07:22.678
Master has presented Dobby
with clothes.

00:07:22.678 --> 00:07:25.333
Dobby is free.

00:07:32.209 --> 00:07:35.038
You lost me my servant!

00:07:42.872 --> 00:07:45.701
You shall not harm Harry Potter.

00:07:45.701 --> 00:07:47.094
Vera--

00:07:58.627 --> 00:08:02.370
Your parents
were meddlesome fools too.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.198
Mark my words, Potter.

00:08:04.198 --> 00:08:08.158
One day soon...

00:08:08.158 --> 00:08:11.379
you are going to meet
the same sticky end.

00:08:16.863 --> 00:08:19.039
Harry Potter freed Dobby.

00:08:19.039 --> 00:08:22.825
How can Dobby ever repay him?

00:08:22.825 --> 00:08:24.784
Just promise me something.

00:08:24.784 --> 00:08:27.351
Anything, sir.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.791
Never try to save my life again.

00:08:37.797 --> 00:08:39.102
Welcome back,
Sir Nicholas.

00:08:39.102 --> 00:08:41.017
Thank you.

00:08:41.017 --> 00:08:42.366
Good evening,
Sir Nicholas.

00:08:42.366 --> 00:08:43.498
Good evening.

00:08:43.498 --> 00:08:44.804
Good to see you,
Sir Nicholas.

00:08:44.804 --> 00:08:47.807
Thank you.

00:08:47.807 --> 00:08:51.724
Hello.

00:08:51.724 --> 00:08:54.640
Hermione!
Welcome back.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:57.207
Thanks, Sir Nicholas.

00:08:59.601 --> 00:09:03.039
Harry!
It's Hermione!

